              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa ukadunga wurigha ghwa waza kuimara Hema chia rose, na madhabahu; ukawanika pazia mnyangonyi ghwa waza. Huwo ukaimeria iyo kazi yose.",
          "type": "text",
