              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Musa nderedimieghe kungia andenyi ya Hema Ekwania kwa kukaia ijo iwingu jerekaieghe aho, na mwengere ghwa BWANA ghorekoghe andenyi yaro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngelo rose Waisraeli werekoghe wikidamba, iji ijo iwingu jawuka kufuma kwa iyo Hema, wandu wa Israeli werekoghe wikizoya kudamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela iji iwingu jakaia jisewukie kufuma Hemenyi, werekoghe wikikaia aeni hata iwingu jiwuke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
